New gTLD Applications Dataset License
=====================================

ICANN columns
-------------

The columns string, u_label, applicant, applicant_country, application_id, type, status, contention_set, announced_on are republished, some normalized as DATA_DICTIONARY.md describes, from the New gTLD Program application listings published by ICANN (the Internet Corporation for Assigned Names and Numbers). ICANN's terms of use apply to them, and Unique Domains claims no rights in them.

Unique Domains columns
----------------------

The columns in_word_corpus, word_popularity_band, comparable_sales_band are Unique Domains data. Copyright (c) Unique Domains.

